FailAt 21
Assign T: RAM:
Stack 16384
Echo "MTec MasterCard large disk test"
Echo ""
Echo "==== MTecTest run" >>SYS:mtectest.log
If NOT EXISTS SYS:mtectest.log
  Echo "This floppy is write protected. Slide the tab and reboot."
  Quit 20
EndIf
Date >>SYS:mtectest.log
Version mtecscsi.device >>SYS:mtectest.log
Version exec.library >>SYS:mtectest.log
MTecPatch >>SYS:mtectest.log
Version mtecscsi.device >>SYS:mtectest.log
MTecPatch STATUS >>SYS:mtectest.log
Echo "Reading the disk layout"
MTecTest SCAN >>SYS:mtectest.log
If NOT EXISTS RAM:Tests
  Echo "No usable disk found. See SYS:mtectest.log"
  Quit 10
EndIf
Execute RAM:Tests
Echo ""
Echo "Read-only tests and the file test are finished."
Echo "The raw write test overwrites 128 KB at 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5 GB and"
Echo "then restores it. A crash or reset during it damages those areas."
Echo "It also runs the last devtest steps, which can upset memory."
MTecTest ASK
If WARN
  Execute RAM:WriteTest
Else
  Echo "Raw write test skipped" >>SYS:mtectest.log
EndIf
Echo "==== MTecTest finished" >>SYS:mtectest.log
Echo "Finished. Reboot before using this Amiga for anything else."
Echo "The log is SYS:mtectest.log, reading it with More:"
Echo ""
More SYS:mtectest.log
